      "what_happened": "Ai2与宾夕法尼亚大学合作者开发了LitPivot，利用通过Asta Paper Finder检索的论文，围绕正在编辑的研究提案组织文献、提供有摘录支撑的批评并建议修改。",
      "what_happened_en": "Ai2, with University of Pennsylvania collaborators, developed LitPivot, which uses papers retrieved through Asta Paper Finder to organize literature around a proposal being edited, offer excerpt-backed critiques, and suggest revisions.",
