      "original_language": "zh",
      "what_happened": "工信部公告成立工业软件标准化技术委员会，编号MIIT/TC11，负责关键技术、互操作、产品服务、融合应用及生态建设等行业标准制修订；第一届由127名委员组成，秘书处由电子第五研究所承担。",
      "what_happened_en": "MIIT announced the establishment of the Industrial Software Standardization Technical Committee, numbered MIIT/TC11, responsible for industry standards on key technologies, interoperability, products and services, integrated applications and ecosystem building; its first term has 127 members and its secretariat is hosted by the Fifth Electronics Research Institute.",
